---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Charter" backLabel="TF Unions" backHref="/">
  <section class="mt-14 sm:mt-20 max-w-[720px]">
    <h1 class="text-[36px] sm:text-[52px] font-bold tracking-[-1.6px] leading-[1.08] text-[#1D1D1F]">
      Non-profit charter.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.5] text-[#6E6E73]">
      The governance rules, student data protections, and financial commitments of TF Unions.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-[#D2D2D7]/70 divide-y divide-[#D2D2D7]/70">
    <div class="py-6">
      <div class="text-[12px] text-[#6E6E73]">Article I</div>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#1D1D1F]">Independent non-profit mandate</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#6E6E73]">
        TF Unions operates strictly as a non-profit educational foundation. Core student access to university admission data, scholarships, roadmaps, and study circles will never be paywalled.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="py-6">
      <div class="text-[12px] text-[#6E6E73]">Article II</div>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#1D1D1F]">Student privacy &amp; single account</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#6E6E73]">
        Student identity records are hosted on our dedicated infrastructure and are never sold or shared with third-party advertisers.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="py-6">
      <div class="text-[12px] text-[#6E6E73]">Article III</div>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#1D1D1F]">Verifiable volunteer credentials</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#6E6E73]">
        Every volunteer and contributor certificate issued by TF Unions carries a permanent serial code verifiable at <a href="https://verify.tfunions.com" class="text-[#002583] font-medium hover:underline">verify.tfunions.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="py-6">
      <div class="text-[12px] text-[#6E6E73]">Article IV</div>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#1D1D1F]">Open-book ledger</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#6E6E73]">
        All incoming community contributions and outgoing server or program expenses are recorded publicly on the <a href="/transparency" class="text-[#002583] font-medium hover:underline">Open Ledger</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
